WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.635
(ominous music)

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:07.707 align:start size:91% position:9%
&gt;&gt;: Alright, partner,
take this scumbag downtown

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
before the Mexicans find him
and blow his a** away.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.946 align:start size:84% position:16%
&gt;&gt;: I am gonna
keep you alive, Chico.

00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:15.081
Comprende.

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:16.850
(laughs)

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.590
(dramatic music)

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:48.014
(dramatic music continues)

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:16.076
&gt;&gt;: No!

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:28.988
(shouting)

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:33.660
(dramatic music)

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.646
(dramatic music continues)

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:15.501
(sad, melancholy music)

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:19.539
(crying) No!

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.710 line:85%
(explosion)

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.710
(bird squeals)

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.515
Is that a bird?

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:30.516
&gt;&gt;: Hey.

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:32.451
Do you know what happened?

00:02:32.484 --> 00:02:34.120 line:85%
&gt;&gt;: No.

00:02:32.484 --> 00:02:34.120
(gun shot)

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:35.822
Oh!

00:02:40.392 --> 00:02:42.395
Oh, I get it.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.564
When I say no, stuff blows up.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.566
(explosion)

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:50.868
Cool.

